---------------------------------------------------------------------------
Note on CSS files
---------------------------------------------------------------------------
This plugin does not ship theme CSS inside the DLL. Any CSS you place in the
plugin css/ folder remains your responsibility (content and license).
If you distribute CSS derived from third-party themes (e.g. Emby community
themes), you must respect their original licenses and credits.

Community acknowledgment: thanks to Aleas (Emby community) for outstanding
theme work that inspired seasonal CSS workflows with this plugin.
